<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Simmer and Jack talks continue.</title>
<headline>Simmer and Jack talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simmer And Jack Mines Ltd on Tuesday advised shareholders that negotiations were still in progress and accordingly, shareholders should continue to exercise caution in dealing in their shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
